Define the foundational RoleAlias value type, alias-name validation, RoleAliasStore interface, a package-level ResolveRoleAlias helper, a sentinel error ErrRoleAliasNotFound, and an in-memory store implementation.

Proposed declarations for organization/role_alias.go:
```go
// path: organization/role_alias.go
package organization

import (
	"context"
	"errors"
	"regexp"
	"time"

	"github.com/tekroo-ai/teams/kernel"
)

var ErrRoleAliasNotFound = errors.New("role alias not found")

var roleAliasPattern = regexp.MustCompile(`^[a-z0-9](?:[a-z0-9.-]{0,62}[a-z0-9])?$`)

type RoleAlias struct {
	SchemaVersion string          `json:"schema_version"`
	Name          string          `json:"name"`
	ActorFQN      kernel.ActorFQN `json:"actor_fqn"`
	Revision      uint64          `json:"revision"`
	CreatedAt     time.Time       `json:"created_at"`
}

func (alias RoleAlias) Validate() error { ... }
func ValidateRoleAliasName(name string) error { ... }

type RoleAliasStore interface {
	Load(ctx context.Context, name string) (RoleAlias, bool, error)
	Save(ctx context.Context, alias RoleAlias) error
	Delete(ctx context.Context, name string) error
	List(ctx context.Context) ([]RoleAlias, error)
}

func ResolveRoleAlias(ctx context.Context, store RoleAliasStore, name string) (kernel.ActorFQN, error) { ... }
```

Proposed declarations for adapters/memory/role_alias_store.go:
```go
// path: adapters/memory/role_alias_store.go
package memory

import (
	"context"
	"sync"

	"github.com/tekroo-ai/teams/organization"
)

type RoleAliasStore struct { ... }

func NewRoleAliasStore() *RoleAliasStore { ... }
```
The in-memory store guards a map[string]organization.RoleAlias behind a sync.Mutex. Save performs Revision increment; Load and Delete return ErrRoleAliasNotFound when the key is absent. List returns a sorted copy.

Implement a MongoDB-backed organization.RoleAliasStore so that operator aliases survive daemon restarts, matching the durability guarantee of RoleStateStore in the same package.

